<title>POLAND: Polish printing house Poligrafia whole IPO sold.</title>
<headline>Polish printing house Poligrafia whole IPO sold.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>All 1,357,280 shares in the initial public offering of Polish printing house Poligrafia SA have been sold, an official at the brokerage offering the issue said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;All (Poligrafia) shares have been sold,&quot; Krzysztof Stefanski of Penetrator brokerage told Reuters.</p>
<p>The company offered 857,280 shares in a large-investor tranche and 500,000 shares to small investors.</p>
<p>It expects to enter the Warsaw bourse's parallel market of smaller, less liquid stocks.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
